They sit down and they start miming a synchronized rowing motion to the beat of a drum

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:19.040
shouting RO which is Norwegian for row. It is a brilliant, entirely organic display of spontaneous

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:24.160
unity. After they beat Senegal, the players on the pitch actually synced up and did the Viking

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:28.640
row with the supporters in the stands. Hundreds of people even did it in front of Norway's Royal

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:33.920
Palace, chanting that they were going to wake up the King. It's just this incredibly vivid reminder

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:39.200
that in a world that feels fragile and unpredictable, people still figure out how to get in the same

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:44.880
boat and row together. Absolutely. And as we look ahead, there are a few key things to watch.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:49.120
Keep a very close eye on the next 10 days to see if the Road to Housing Act automatically

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:54.480
becomes law without a presidential signature or if a veto sets up a historic override battle.

