Also, watch how global power grids, particularly in Europe, manage the compounding simultaneous

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:07.280
pressures of extreme summer heat and the booming, unrelenting energy demands of AI data centers.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:11.600
If physical items like video game discs and the wheels on manufactured houses are disappearing

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:15.840
